 "source_file": "corpus/src/kotlin/collections.kt",
 "source": "// listOf / mapOf / destructuring, and COMPLETE trailing-comma policy.\n\nfun demo(pair: Pair<Int, String>) {\n    val short = listOf(1, 2, 3) // stays flat\n    val dropped = listOf(1, 2, 3,) // trailing comma on a fitting list is removed\n    val xs = listOf(\n        1,\n        2,\n        3,\n    ) // already broken: COMPLETE adds the trailing commas\n    val config = mapOf(\"host\" to \"localhost\", \"port\" to 8080, \"debug\" to true)\n    val (id, name) = pair // destructuring\n    val built = buildList {\n        add(id)\n        add(name.length)\n    }\n}\n",
